            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.6.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Musa wacu ni Mungu kumae, Nen, kinde m’abiwok ba nyithindho mir Israel, man abiwacu igi kumae, Mungu pa kwaruwu ora i beng’wu; man gibiwacu ira kumae, Nyinge ng’a? abiwacu ang’o igi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nyu 1:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.1.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E Mungu wacu ni Musa kumae, ANUTI KUM ANUTI: man ewacu kumae, Ibiwacu kumeni ni nyithindho mir Israel, ANUTI ora i beng’wu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Mungu wacu ni Musa kendo kumae, Ibiwacu kumae ni nyithindho mir Israel, Yehova, Mungu pa kwaruwu, Mungu pa Ibrahim, Mungu pa Isak, man Mungu pa Yakobo, uora i beng’wu: maeni nyinga mi nja, man maeni en e lem poi para cil kum dhanum’utuk ceke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cidhi, cok judongo mir Israel karacelo, man iwac igi kumae, Yehova, Mungu pa kwaruwu, Mungu pa Ibrahim, pa Isak, man pa Yakobo, uwok i bang’a, uwacu kumae, Aliewowu andha, man aneno lembe m’utimbre i kumwu i Misiri: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man awacu kumae, Abiwodhowu woko kud i masendi mi Misiri man abiterowu i ng’om pa Jakanani, man Jahiti, ku Jaamori, ku Japerizi, man Jahivi, ku Jayebusi, i ng’om ma molo cak ku kic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man gibiwinjo dwendi: man ibicidho, in ku judongo mir Israel, bang’ ubimo mi Misiri, man wubiwacu ire kumae, Yehova, Mungu mi Juebrania, urombo kudwa: man kawono, wakwei, wek wacidh mi woth mi ceng’ adek i langa, kara walam ni Yehova Mungurnwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ang’eyo nia ubimo mi Misiri bimio iwu woth ungo, ungo, ku cing’ ma tek de ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E abirieyo cinga, man abigoyo Misiri ku musana para ceke m’abitimo i kinde: man yo ng’ei maeno ebiweko wucidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.35"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ai 12:35",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man abimio bero ni dhanu maeni i wang’ Jumisiri: man ebitimbre, nia, ka wucidho, wubicidho mananu ngo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento ku ba mon ceke ng’atuman bikwayu jadhugola pare, ku ng’atu ma en e umondo i ot pare, ku jamb mola ma tar, man jamb mola ma kwar, ku kendi: man wubironyo ko wotwu, ku nyigwu; man wubicoko piny mi Jumisiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.3.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
